<p>Write a tale about it, discuss it with the people <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/chat-guide">in the IRC chatroom</a>, draw some art with it as a subject, write a poem, mention that it's one of your favorites when asked. If you really like an SCP and feel like you're bursting with uncontrollable zeal over it, it's a better idea to put that energy into making a work of your own honoring it, than telling everyone else OMG IT'S AWESOME (because there's no guarantee that others will feel the same way about it). This SCP has been around for some time.</p>
